>> source: Applied Kitchen
>> serves: 6
>> time: 10 minutes

Dice @English or hot house cucumbers{2%each} into large chunks. Reserve some for garnish.

In a #blender{}, add the cucumbers, @agave{0.25 to 0.5%cup}, and one cup of @water{1%cup}. Blend until smooth. Transfer to a #pitcher{}.

Stir in @fresh lime juice{0.5%cup} (about 4 limes), five cups of @water{5%cups}, and @chia seeds{2%Tbsp}.

Pour over @ice{} and garnish with the reserved cucumbers and @limes{some}.
